  "rationale": [
    "R6.2 consumer geometry contained no C11C editorial role-style contract for subtitle and CTA.",
    "R6.2 used hard-coded subtitle/CTA colors and left-origin text drawing instead of role-derived palette colors and centered alignment.",
    "C11CVisualEditorialLayer uses a centered Inter-Bold header role with header_secondary color and black outline, and a centered Noto Sans Mono footer role with footer_data color and black outline.",
    "The D consumer retains C11C header horizontal centering and bottom vertical alignment, projecting the header role to a 22px one-line subtitle in the reserved 29px band after the approved R6 family title; CTA retains the C11C 16px top-aligned footer role.",
